@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?limit=10&offset=0

### Search by text
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/search?q=keyboard

### Filter by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?category=Accessories&limit=10

### Filter by supplier
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?supplier_id=SUP-HBT-001

### Filter by price range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?min_price=50&max_price=200&sort=unit_price

### Product detail by SKU
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/HB-LAP-1001

### Product detail by numeric id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/1

### Simulate external service delay
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?simulate_delay_ms=750

### Simulate external service failure
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?force_error=true
